metadata/doc = "D4-01 ENV D: shared material of every character's merged LOD2 (Skeleton3D/CrowdLod, world/characters/_tools/crowd_lod.gd); albedo = per-vertex mean albedo of the source materials. Double-sided (D-165): skirt / dress / apron hems show their inside, not a see-through gap."
